<title>THAILAND: Aromatics sees 1.0 bln baht '97 net profit.</title>
<headline>Aromatics sees 1.0 bln baht '97 net profit.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Aromatics (Thailand) Plc said in a filing to the Thai Stock Exchange on Monday that it expects to make a net profit of 1.0 billion baht from a turnover of 11.0 billion baht in 1997.</p>
<p>It gave no further details.</p>
</text>
